<%--
Test_Event_Dispatch_Snapshot - Regression test for handler self-deregistration during dispatch

Reproduces the mutate-during-iterate bug in event_trigger(): a .once() wrapper
splices itself out of the live callback array while trigger() is iterating it,
which made trigger() skip the next handler in the list.
--%>
<Define:Test_Event_Dispatch_Snapshot>
  <h2>Event Dispatch Snapshot Test</h2>
  <Test_Dispatch_Child $sid="child" />
  <div $sid="results"></div>
</Define:Test_Event_Dispatch_Snapshot>
